# Line-ending and binary policy.
#
# Our own files keep the repository default (core.autocrlf behaviour as configured
# on each machine). The rules below exist for two reasons: vendored third-party
# sources must stay byte-for-byte identical to upstream, and binary artifacts must
# never be treated as text.

* text=auto

# Vendored trees: never rewrite line endings inside third_party/
# (see third_party/README.md rule 1: we do not edit third-party sources).
/third_party/** -text

# Binaries
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.lib binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.iobj binary
*.ipdb binary
*.exp binary
